2026-02-08 23:02:35 [kimi-k2.5] - Unix sockets (`/tmp/sloppy.sock`) and SSH (6669) for alternative ingress
2026-02-08 23:02:35 [kimi-k2.5] - Discord bot egress via GatewayIntentBits
