2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] events. Here's what you should know about Kalshi:
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] • What is Kalshi?*
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - A regulated prediction market platform based in the US
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Allows trading on yes/no questions about future events
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Operates under CFTC (Commodity Futures Trading Commission) regulation
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] • How it works:*
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Users buy "Yes" or "No" shares on event outcomes
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Prices reflect the market's collective probability assessment
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Shares settle at 1 if correct, 0 if incorrect
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Example: "Will inflation exceed 3% next quarter?" - Yes shares might trade at $0.65 (65%
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] probability)
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] • Types of markets:*
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Economic indicators (GDP, inflation, unemployment)
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Political events (elections, legislation)
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Weather and natural events
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Sports outcomes
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Technology and business developments
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] • Key features:*
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Legal in the US (unlike many other prediction markets)
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Real-money trading with actual financial stakes
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Transparent pricing based on supply and demand
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Educational tool for understanding probability and risk
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] • Purpose:*
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Price discovery - aggregates information to predict outcomes
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Risk management - allows hedging against specific events
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] - Entertainment and engagement with current events
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] 
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] Kalshi essentially creates a financial market for information and predictions, where prices reflect
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] collective wisdom about future probabilities. It's like a stock market for event outcomes rather
2026-02-19 19:14:52 [deepseek-chat] than company performance.
