2026-02-24 16:11:18 [kimi-k2.5] Notes:
2026-02-24 16:11:18 [kimi-k2.5] - Windows batch requires double quotes around arguments, not single quotes
2026-02-24 16:11:18 [kimi-k2.5] - Inner quotes in the JSON must be escaped as `\"`
